pan></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Construct an invariant from a loop invariant `inv` and a break condition `onBreak`.\n\n`inv` holds at the end of every loop iteration (including the breaking one), and `onBreak` holds in\naddition to `inv` once the loop is done. For a normal `while` loop `onBreak` can be taken as the\nnegation of the loop condition.\n","docLink":"./Std/Internal/Do/Triple/SpecLemmas.html#Std.Internal.Do.RepeatInvariant.ofInvariantAndBreak","kind":"def","line":2048,"name":"Std.Internal.Do.RepeatInvariant.ofInvariantAndBreak","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Std/Internal/Do/Triple/SpecLemmas.lean#L2048-L2059"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Internal/Do/Triple/SpecLemmas.html#Std.Internal.Do.Spec.repeatM\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">Spec</span>.<span class=\"name\">repeatM</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α </span><span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> v</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">Pred</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> uₚ}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">EPred</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> uₑ}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a hr